      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's a pretty steady hum honestly. i don't really get the goblin stuff, i'm just looking for actual repair advice. between the capacitor and the contactor, which one is more likely to cause that specific \"humming but not spinning\" thing? also how do i safely test the capacitor?",
